{"scope":"knowledge/storyboard","page":1,"pageSize":24,"total":143,"totalPages":6,"items":[{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-28296bcd74de","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"可替换实现：让「要改」的时候改的是实现方式，不是戏","description":"**本套件不内置任何平台的审核标准，不预测任何内容能否通过，也不给出题材禁令**。 标准随平台、地区、时间和分发方式变化，写进技能只会同时做到两件坏事：过时，以及把 创作者本可以拍的东西提前劝退。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-write/references/substitutable-realization.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-write","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-2a3028f0584c","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"短剧评审门禁（review gates）——写完/做完必过，且必须举证","description":"> 借鉴 worldwonderer 的 `reviewed_invariant` 纪律：**评审必须引用具体节拍/字段/台词，不许说「不够抓人」这种空话。** > 每一项打分 1–10，**任一 ≤6 就重写**；标 ⛔ 的是硬伤，**必须修**、不接受\"宽进\"。 > 顺序：写 bible → 过 A、B；写每集 script/lines → 过 C、D、E；出片 → 过 F、G。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["Easel-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/Easel-short-drama/references/drama-review-rubric.md","ext":".md","pack":"Easel-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-2a54fbcb0c61","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"起点—变化—终点：视频运动说明","description":"1. 目的、输入与权属 2. 起止边界清单 3. 运动说明的七个部分 4. 从结构化规格到自然语言 5. 输出、常见问题与检查","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/motion-recipe.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-2a83321bc792","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"一张参考图可以决定什么","description":"绑定参考图等于告诉下游“哪些地方照着它”。不说明边界，身份参考会越权决定服装、构图、背景或文字。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/reference-roles.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-2b500ae5b1ca","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"冲突、揭示、反转与回报的条件方法","description":"这是一组按项目条件选择的工具，不是题材公式。先问作品承诺什么体验，再选择能让人物付出代价、 让观众获得回报的机制。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/reveal-reversal-payoff.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-2d6bcce55858","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"母版、补拍与替代版","description":"缩小提示词范围经常是正确修复。危险不是“变短”，而是把只拍了一部分的版本悄悄当成母版，使未被 它承担的对白、反应、揭示或终点从此无人负责。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/pickup-and-alternate.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-2d840992386b","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"节奏曲线设计","description":"微短剧的节奏不是\"一直爽\"，而是\"紧→松→更紧→松→最紧\"的波形。就像过山车，持续加速反而麻木，有起有落才刺激。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer/references/rhythm-curve.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-2fcc92eaa6d0","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"图片提示词审查量表与合成案例","description":"1. 审查方式 2. 证据量表 3. 完成前结构检查 4. 合成正例 5. 合成反例","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts/references/review-and-fixtures.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-35794cf010a0","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"制作质量检查：各环节怎么审、返工怎么防","description":"来自对完整生产链返工原因的定性案例阅读，示例均为合成改写。审查方法见 [review-method.md](review-method.md)。本文展开 `REV-08` 与 `REV-09`：检查具体 必须保留的内容是否还在，而不是用样本规模、固定数量或所谓命中率证明质量。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-review/references/production-quality-gates.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-review","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-3948263c77e2","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"导演阐述工艺：拆分/分镜前的项目级指令","description":"来自对导演阐述如何约束完整生产链的定性案例阅读，示例均为合成改写。导演阐述是 整条流程里影响很大的人工输入：写在拆分/分镜之前，约束全剧后续工作——分镜 格式、摄影职责、节奏方向和已知能力条件。在本套件中，它落入 `short-drama.json#/creator_authority` 中的 `visual_direction` 与 `production_profile`， 由本技能在 `项目开发/director-brief.md` 中起草候选并展示语义差异。创作者接…","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/director-brief-craft.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-3af0e802c492","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"题材、画风、场景与提示词 Know-how 学习","description":"本流程扩展完整项目链阅读，专门积累“在什么题材承诺、制作形态、视觉方向和场景职责下， 哪种提示词机制可能解决什么问题”。它不做提示词词频、风格代码排行或任务成功率分析。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-knowhow/references/prompt-production-learning.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-knowhow","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-3b407b8465f1","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"节奏曲线系统","description":"每集时长约 1.5–3 分钟，内部节奏遵循三段式：","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter/references/rhythm-curve.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-4159fa045772","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"从剧本提取资产出现记录","description":"出现记录说明“某段剧本在某处要求了什么”，它不是资产身份本身。先记录出现，再判断 它对应哪个资产，可以避免把同一人物的几套衣服拆成几个人，也能避免把两个同称谓的人 误并成一人。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-assets/references/occurrence-extraction.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-assets","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-44b609dc51df","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"视频提示词阶段契约","description":"本阶段只拥有 `剧集/<EP>/视频提示词.md` 中的 `MOTION-...` 项与按需的时间线音乐章节。它继承镜头 起点、终点、时长、对白和冻结帧，不回写分镜或视觉设定：镜头边界、职责、起终状态和关键帧正文都不在 本阶段手里。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/stage-contract.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-4541f2f494f5","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"原著分析审查表","description":"`项目开发/source-analysis/` 下由 `$short-drama-novel-analyze` 发布的分析层： `_index.json`、`triage.md`、`chapters/*.md`、`story-units.md`、`rhythm-and-emotion.md`、 `characters.md`、`world.md`、`adaptation-value.md`、`episode-candidates.jsonl`。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-review/references/rubric-source-analysis.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-review","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-45ecf3ae3006","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"机制循环与耗尽","description":"1. 使用方式与规则分级 2. 循环是引擎与分集之间的那一层 3. 写清一次运行 4. 一次运行与一次重复的区别 5. 循环耗尽：症状与根因 6. 换代：先处置，再把紧迫性交过去 7. 一种常见变体：落差型循环 8. 循环与单集契约的关系 9. 合成示例 10. 失败征兆与审查问题","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/mechanism-loop.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-46ec59f7c32c","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"反派设计体系","description":"微短剧的反派不是\"坏人\"那么简单。反派的质量直接决定了爽点的质量——主角打脸一个路人甲，观众无感；打脸一个嚣张了十集的恶人，观众拍手叫好。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer/references/villain-design.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-485684c0c8e5","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"Location / View 设计","description":"陈设阶段、时段、天气、光态。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-assets/references/location-and-view.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-assets","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-4becb52f096a","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"摄影机、环境声音与只读连续性","description":"transition 将两段分开。 production profile 继承的 `taste_option`。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/camera-audio-continuity.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-4d78876afaec","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"爽点矩阵","description":"观众看微短剧的核心诉求就是\"爽\"。爽点设计得好，观众欲罢不能；设计得差，观众昏昏欲睡。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/short-drama/references/satisfaction-matrix.md","ext":".md","pack":"short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-5035d0f0b9d6","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"人物设定图与 Look Variant","description":"人物设定图必须始终可识别为同一个 accepted identity，同时只呈现一套自洽 Look。不要把互不兼容的服装、发型、伤势、年龄或风化状态平均成一个合成人。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts/references/character-and-look.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-51620f9009d6","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"场次级声音戏剧设计","description":"剧本阶段只写**故事需要听见、撤掉或留白的声音事实**，不替逐镜提示词做混音。声音要改变观众 注意、空间感或人物压力，而不是每场复制一份环境音清单。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-write/references/scene-sound-dramaturgy.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-write","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-56ce041c26a3","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"观众此刻可以知道什么","description":"背影、门缝、画外声、浅景深和遮挡会决定观众何时知道一个人是谁、看见证据或发现门后有人。 需要同时防两种错：该给的信息被漂亮构图挡住；不该给的信息被镜头提前泄露。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/audience-reveal.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-5888aaaa5e0b","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"资产拆解审查清单","description":"资产设定完成前，每个下游引用都要解析到明确的身份条目，且变体必须在引用的剧情范围内有效。 未解决的出现项继续保持未决；不得为了让提示词或分镜继续工作，猜一个看似合理的 ID。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-assets/references/asset-review-checklist.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-assets","bytes":null}}]}
